<#
.SYNOPSIS
  Fetches the Bistro glTF scene content (Spec 0037 / Plan 0037 Milestone 2).

.DESCRIPTION
  Downloads exactly the 345 files the Bistro scene actually references
  (bistro.gltf, bistro.bin, and the 343 MSFT_texture_dds .dds textures) from
  NVIDIA-RTX/RTXDI-Assets at the pinned commit below, into content/bistro/
  (gitignored; Spec 0037 repository content policy: collections over 50 MB
  are fetched, never committed). About 2.0 GiB.

  Source: https://github.com/NVIDIA-RTX/RTXDI-Assets (bistro/), commit
  1da7b749ef0e3fb606ab46dde8e5bfbacd078a02. Files are Git LFS objects served
  by media.githubusercontent.com. Licensing: tools/content/
  bistro_source.provenance.txt (MIT repository + CC-BY 4.0 original scene).

  Pinning: every manifest entry is (path relative to bistro/, Git LFS oid,
  byte size). A Git LFS oid IS the SHA256 of the file content, so each file
  is verified by size and SHA256 before it is kept; nothing is trusted by
  name. The manifest was generated once from the LFS pointer files at the
  pinned commit (raw.githubusercontent.com) for the images the glTF's
  MSFT_texture_dds extensions reference, and every oid/size was confirmed
  against the LFS batch API. Upstream files the scene does not reference
  (47 more .dds, bistro_without_paintings.gltf) are deliberately excluded.

  Resumable and idempotent: files already present with the right size and
  hash are skipped; an interrupted file resumes from its .partial bytes via
  an HTTP Range request. A file that fails verification is deleted and
  re-downloaded, up to -MaxRetries attempts. Exit code 0 only when all 345
  files verify.

  Test contract (Plan 0037): tests that need this content are tagged
  [bistro] (ctest label "content") and SKIP -- never FAIL -- when it is
  absent, printing: run tools/content/fetch_bistro.ps1. The location they
  read is the CMake cache variable ATLANTIS_BISTRO_CONTENT_DIR (default
  <repo>/content/bistro), which matches this script's default -Destination.

.PARAMETER Destination
  Target directory. Default: <repo>/content/bistro.

.PARAMETER MaxRetries
  Attempts per file before giving up. Default: 4.

.EXAMPLE
  powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools/content/fetch_bistro.ps1
#>
param(
  [string]$Destination = (Join-Path $PSScriptRoot '..\..\content\bistro'),
  [int]$MaxRetries = 4
)

$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'
$ProgressPreference = 'SilentlyContinue'
[Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol = [Net.SecurityProtocolType]::Tls12

$Commit = '1da7b749ef0e3fb606ab46dde8e5bfbacd078a02'
$BaseUrl = "https://media.githubusercontent.com/media/NVIDIA-RTX/RTXDI-Assets/$Commit/bistro/"
$ExpectedCount = 345

